      "objective": "Show the timeline from pathogen identification to vaccine licensure for key diseases. Use a horizontal bar/timeline chart referencing the vaccination innovation figure. Highlight that early vaccines took decades (typhoid: 105 years) while COVID-19 took under 1 year."
